    "description": {
      "content": "Representative OpenAPI description of the Edgegap Arbitrium REST API for distributed edge game-server orchestration. Covers applications, application versions, deployments, sessions, matchmaking, relays/networking, metrics, and private fleets. Auto-deploy dedicated game servers to Edgegap's global network of edge locations. This document is a faithful, representative subset authored for cataloging; consult the official Edgegap documentation for the complete, authoritative reference.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Edgegap Support",
